        [hello]     ->  index 0 --> index of the first character 'h'  
        [word]      ->  index 6 --> index of the char 'w' in the OG text
        [its]       ->  index 12 --> index of 'i' in the OF text
        [me]        ->  index 16 --< index of 'm'

